    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Week 11 SLO Definition",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 14,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 6
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### sparebox-web SLOs\n\n**Availability:** 99% successful HTTP probes.\n\n**Latency:** p99 probe duration <= 250 ms.\n\n**Error budget:** 1% unsuccessful probes.\n\n**Burn rate:** observed error ratio / 0.01.\n\nThese are project-defined objectives for the Sparebox demo service."
      }
